note Command to Request: the reading commands become a Query, the map edits an Edit, repin its own Request. Each argument struct converts through its own From, so names become PathName or TextFragment, numbers become StepIndex, Under, LineNumber, Levels or Count, and a name that cannot be a PathName is carried as the MapError for exec to report.

