file crates/codemap/src/main.rs
symbol run
lines 0 52
hash e19274bc89dc4430
note Text mode. Parse before indexing so a usage error costs nothing. Then build the index from the cache and tree-sitter, load the map, and hand exec a Servers, which starts a language server only when the command needs one and reports its notices on stderr. Servers is dropped before anything is printed, so the servers shut down first. Output is printed only after the save, so a line saying a step was added never appears for a change that did not reach the disk. A command Failure prints what the command produced so far on stdout and the failure on stderr with exit 2; check relies on this.

